// =============================================================================
// let-DemoIdentityLogs.kql — the ZERO-PERMISSION way to get the demo dataset.
//
// "Save as function" (Method 1 in the README) needs write permission on the
// workspace. If you only have read access — common in shared/training tenants —
// paste THIS WHOLE BLOCK above any lab query instead. No saved object, same
// 64 rows, works in Log Analytics, Sentinel AND Azure Data Explorer.
//
// Usage: copy everything, paste into the query editor, replace the final
//        "DemoIdentityLogs | take 10" with the lab query you want to run.
// =============================================================================
